cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying data, please cite the article below."
title: "How Stale Is Too Stale? Bounding Consecutive Information Outages in V2X Collision Warning"
abstract: >-
  Simulation kernel, analysis scripts and figure generators for a
  freshness-budget (C0), mean-loss (C1) and outage-tail (C2) safety-contract
  study of V2X collision warning, including a re-validation of C2 against the
  public NIST outdoor C-V2X capture dataset and an availability budget derived
  from the measured coverage-outage process.
type: software
